div.p:
        Dear ${object.partner_id.name},



        We would like to request a quotation for the following products:



        % if object.batch_rfq_id:
        Batch RFQ Reference: ${object.batch_rfq_id.name}

        Description: ${object.batch_rfq_id.description}

        % if object.batch_rfq_id.date_deadline:
        Response Deadline: ${format_date(object.batch_rfq_id.date_deadline)}

        % endif


        % endif





                    Product
                    Quantity
                    Unit
                    Required Date



                % for line in object.order_line:


                    ${line.name}
                    ${line.product_qty}
                    ${line.product_uom.name}
                    ${format_date(line.date_planned)}

                % endfor





        Please provide your best quotation including:


Unit prices

Delivery terms and dates

Payment terms

Validity period of the quotation


        % if object.notes:

Additional Notes:

${object.notes | safe}
        % endif



        Thank you for your attention. We look forward to your prompt response.



        Best regards,

        ${object.user_id.name}

        ${object.company_id.name}
